#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:2
#: a481444aec5745c6a40775ee57a3503b
msgid "Phase-Field Fracture"
msgstr "相场断裂"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:4
#: f20e7c0f0d1d4a5aa660641a221ce37c
msgid ""
"Brittle fracture as energy minimization. A damage field :math:`\\alpha \\in "
"[0, 1]` smears the crack over a length :math:`\\ell`. Where the crack "
"starts, the path it takes and when it runs then all follow from minimizing "
"one energy [Francfort1998]_ [Bourdin2000]_. The script "
"``examples/solid/phase_field_fracture/phase_field_fracture.py`` runs the "
"single-edge-notched tension (SENT) benchmark [Miehe2010]_ in plane strain."
msgstr ""
"把脆性断裂看作能量最小化问题。损伤场 :math:`\\alpha \\in [0, 1]` 把裂纹弥散在长度 :math:`\\ell` "
"的范围内，于是裂纹在哪里萌生、沿哪条路径扩展、何时失稳扩展，都由同一个能量的最小化决定 [Francfort1998]_ "
"[Bourdin2000]_。脚本 "
"``examples/solid/phase_field_fracture/phase_field_fracture.py`` "
"在平面应变下运行单边缺口拉伸（SENT）基准算例 [Miehe2010]_。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:11
#: 7597c1caecaf4d0e9916ac3d1abec798
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The new ingredient over :doc:`plasticity_strip` is an **inequality "
"constraint**: damage cannot heal, :math:`\\alpha_n \\ge \\alpha_{n-1}`. "
"Every load step is therefore a bound-constrained minimization. The script "
"solves it by alternate minimization, and both subproblems use ``vi_solve`` "
"from `torch-sla <https://www.torchsla.com/>`_, a Newton solve with bounds."
msgstr ""
"与 :doc:`plasticity_strip` 相比，新增的要素是 **不等式约束**\\ ：损伤不可愈合，\\ :math:`\\alpha_n "
"\\ge \\alpha_{n-1}`\\ 。因此每个载荷步都是一个带界约束的最小化问题。脚本用交替最小化求解它，两个子问题都使用 `torch-sla"
" <https://www.torchsla.com/>`_ 中的 ``vi_solve``——一种带上下界的牛顿求解。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:19
#: 23b38612775441afbab084d34a3c1051
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:21
#: 3788be0860864cafa25e69db2a515027
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The energy of a displacement :math:`\\mathbf{u}` and a damage field "
":math:`\\alpha` is"
msgstr "位移 :math:`\\mathbf{u}` 与损伤场 :math:`\\alpha` 的能量为"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:24
#: 1404ce4d32894ee48052af0cceffe272
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\mathcal{E}(\\mathbf{u}, \\alpha)\n"
"= \\int_\\Omega \\Bigl[ g(\\alpha)\\, \\psi_D(\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon})\n"
"  + \\psi_R(\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon}) \\Bigr] \\mathrm{d}\\Omega\n"
"+ \\frac{G_c}{c_w} \\int_\\Omega \\Bigl[ \\frac{w(\\alpha)}{\\ell}\n"
"  + \\ell\\, |\\nabla\\alpha|^2 \\Bigr] \\mathrm{d}\\Omega,\n"
"\\qquad g(\\alpha) = (1 - \\alpha)^2 + g_0,"
msgstr ""
"\\mathcal{E}(\\mathbf{u}, \\alpha)\n"
"= \\int_\\Omega \\Bigl[ g(\\alpha)\\, \\psi_D(\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon})\n"
"  + \\psi_R(\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon}) \\Bigr] \\mathrm{d}\\Omega\n"
"+ \\frac{G_c}{c_w} \\int_\\Omega \\Bigl[ \\frac{w(\\alpha)}{\\ell}\n"
"  + \\ell\\, |\\nabla\\alpha|^2 \\Bigr] \\mathrm{d}\\Omega,\n"
"\\qquad g(\\alpha) = (1 - \\alpha)^2 + g_0,"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:33
#: bf7c174d4fd04535ab23227da6c6e457
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"with :math:`\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon} = \\tfrac12(\\nabla\\mathbf{u} + "
"\\nabla\\mathbf{u}^T)` and a small residual stiffness :math:`g_0`."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon} = \\tfrac12(\\nabla\\mathbf{u} + "
"\\nabla\\mathbf{u}^T)`\\ ，\\ :math:`g_0` 是一个小的残余刚度。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:36
#: 832c557c170f4f5a9db4d7cdeaa637d6
msgid ""
"**Crack model.** AT1 takes :math:`w(\\alpha) = \\alpha` and :math:`c_w = "
"8/3`. It has an elastic phase: no damage forms below a critical stress "
"[Pham2011]_. AT2 takes :math:`w(\\alpha) = \\alpha^2` and :math:`c_w = 2`, "
"and damages at any load. Choose with ``--model``."
msgstr ""
"**裂纹模型。** AT1 取 :math:`w(\\alpha) = \\alpha`\\ 、\\ :math:`c_w = 8/3`\\ "
"，它有一个弹性阶段：应力低于临界值时不产生损伤 [Pham2011]_。AT2 取 :math:`w(\\alpha) = \\alpha^2`\\ "
"、\\ :math:`c_w = 2`\\ ，在任意载荷下都会产生损伤。用 ``--model`` 选择。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:40
#: 32c4ae54d41e44d381ba39dc22a600c6
msgid ""
"**Energy split** [Amor2009]_. Only the tensile volumetric part and the "
"deviatoric part are degraded, so compression does not crack:"
msgstr "**能量分解** [Amor2009]_。只有受拉的体积部分和偏量部分会被退化，因此压缩不会产生裂纹："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:43
#: b46be10246a24d118b5db9caafc1a899
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\psi_D = \\tfrac{\\kappa}{2} \\langle \\operatorname{tr}\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon} \\rangle_+^2\n"
"        + \\mu\\, |\\operatorname{dev}\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon}|^2,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\psi_R = \\tfrac{\\kappa}{2} \\langle \\operatorname{tr}\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon} \\rangle_-^2."
msgstr ""
"\\psi_D = \\tfrac{\\kappa}{2} \\langle \\operatorname{tr}\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon} \\rangle_+^2\n"
"        + \\mu\\, |\\operatorname{dev}\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon}|^2,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\psi_R = \\tfrac{\\kappa}{2} \\langle \\operatorname{tr}\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon} \\rangle_-^2."

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:50
#: e5e627800f314c16ae77405eaa27de05
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The script writes the two energy densities once, in ``PhaseFieldModel``. "
":meth:`~tensormesh.ElementAssembler.energy` integrates them, and autograd "
"turns the integrals into the residuals "
":math:`\\partial\\mathcal{E}/\\partial\\mathbf{u}` and "
":math:`\\partial\\mathcal{E}/\\partial\\alpha`."
msgstr ""
"脚本只在 ``PhaseFieldModel`` 中写一次这两个能量密度。\\ "
":meth:`~tensormesh.ElementAssembler.energy` 对它们积分，autograd 再把积分转换为残差 "
":math:`\\partial\\mathcal{E}/\\partial\\mathbf{u}` 和 "
":math:`\\partial\\mathcal{E}/\\partial\\alpha`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:58
#: 5e5aa6b2a3b940a48b0c0664969a5f63
msgid "Irreversibility as bounds"
msgstr "以界约束表达不可逆性"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:60
#: a7f35e0c2a16411483070c4dbca257fa
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"At load step :math:`n` the damage is sought in :math:`[\\alpha_{n-1}, 1]`. A"
" minimizer under these bounds satisfies, node by node,"
msgstr "在载荷步 :math:`n`\\ ，损伤在 :math:`[\\alpha_{n-1}, 1]` 中求解。在这些界约束下的极小点逐节点满足"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:63
#: 70a4a8d3538345588463ee323f441378
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\alpha_i = \\alpha_{n-1,i} \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\partial_i \\mathcal{E} \\ge 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\alpha_{n-1,i} < \\alpha_i < 1 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\partial_i \\mathcal{E} = 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\alpha_i = 1 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\partial_i \\mathcal{E} \\le 0."
msgstr ""
"\\alpha_i = \\alpha_{n-1,i} \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\partial_i \\mathcal{E} \\ge 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\alpha_{n-1,i} < \\alpha_i < 1 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\partial_i \\mathcal{E} = 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\alpha_i = 1 \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\partial_i \\mathcal{E} \\le 0."

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:71
#: 63ee0bb2178b420dabfdeb0402bdf7e0
msgid ""
"Either the residual vanishes, or the node rests on a bound that the residual"
" pushes against. This is a variational inequality, and it is exactly what "
"``torch_sla.vi_solve(residual, x0, lower=..., upper=..., jacobian_fn=...)`` "
"solves. The method is reduced-space active-set Newton, the algorithm of "
"PETSc's ``SNESVINEWTONRSLS`` [Benson2006]_. Each Newton step solves for the "
"nodes off their bounds, then updates which nodes rest on a bound."
msgstr ""
"要么残差为零，要么该节点停在一个界上，且残差把它推向界外。这是一个变分不等式，正是 ``torch_sla.vi_solve(residual, x0,"
" lower=..., upper=..., jacobian_fn=...)`` 所求解的问题。所用方法是降维空间的有效集牛顿法，即 PETSc 的 "
"``SNESVINEWTONRSLS`` 所用的算法 [Benson2006]_。每个牛顿步先对不在界上的节点求解，再更新哪些节点停在界上。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:78
#: 1824bdfe171c4fe9a326f304d4369d5e
msgid ""
"Prescribed values are bounds as well: ``lower == upper`` fixes a component. "
"The displacement Dirichlet conditions are imposed this way, so the "
"displacement solve needs no :class:`~tensormesh.Condenser`. A pre-crack can "
"be prescribed the same way, as :math:`\\alpha = 1` held on a line of nodes "
"(the ``alpha_fixed`` argument). The benchmark below uses a slit in the mesh "
"instead, so the notch faces are free from the start."
msgstr ""
"给定值同样是界约束：\\ ``lower == upper`` 即固定该分量。位移的狄利克雷边界条件就是这样施加的，因此位移求解不需要 "
":class:`~tensormesh.Condenser`\\ 。预制裂纹也可以用同样的方式给定，即在一条节点线上保持 :math:`\\alpha "
"= 1`\\ （\\ ``alpha_fixed`` 参数）。下面的基准算例改为在网格中开一条狭缝，使缺口面从一开始就是自由的。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:87
#: c9e8a2f163ef42b2acc570165237d7e7
msgid "Alternate minimization"
msgstr "交替最小化"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:89
#: d6741796e8034d8580c949be50c10440
msgid "Each load step alternates between the two fields until they agree:"
msgstr "每个载荷步在两个场之间交替求解，直到二者相容："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:91
#: 24bc8f78dedc45f1bb764de11d371b55
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Displacement**, with :math:`\\alpha` fixed. :math:`\\mathcal{E}` is convex"
" in :math:`\\mathbf{u}` but only piecewise quadratic, since the split "
"switches with the sign of "
":math:`\\operatorname{tr}\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon}`. Newton with a line "
"search takes a few steps."
msgstr ""
"**位移**\\ ，固定 :math:`\\alpha`\\ 。\\ :math:`\\mathcal{E}` 关于 "
":math:`\\mathbf{u}` 是凸的，但只是分片二次的，因为能量分解随 "
":math:`\\operatorname{tr}\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon}` 的符号切换。带线搜索的牛顿法只需几步。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:95
#: f17d298ae98a4b81903039982cc06b93
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Damage**, with :math:`\\mathbf{u}` fixed. For AT1 and AT2, "
":math:`\\mathcal{E}` is quadratic in :math:`\\alpha`, so this is a bound-"
"constrained quadratic program. Its Hessian does not depend on "
":math:`\\alpha` and is assembled once."
msgstr ""
"**损伤**\\ ，固定 :math:`\\mathbf{u}`\\ 。对 AT1 和 AT2，\\ :math:`\\mathcal{E}` 关于 "
":math:`\\alpha` 是二次的，因此这是一个带界约束的二次规划。它的 Hessian 不依赖于 :math:`\\alpha`\\ "
"，只需装配一次。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:99
#: 86cf6c6a22434fe9a7d8296fb6a469a4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Stop** when the displacement residual on the free degrees of freedom, "
"evaluated with the new damage, is below :math:`10^{-4}` of the reaction "
"forces."
msgstr "**停止**\\ ：用新的损伤计算出的、未约束自由度上的位移残差小于反力的 :math:`10^{-4}` 倍时停止。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:107
#: 4d7978f32e9a4284852020b969e42156
msgid ""
"The two Jacobians are bilinear forms. As in every TensorMesh form, "
"``forward`` describes one quadrature point and one pair of basis functions. "
"The point data ``disp`` and ``alpha`` arrive as ``graddisp`` and ``alpha``:"
msgstr ""
"两个雅可比矩阵都是双线性形式。与 TensorMesh 的所有形式一样，\\ ``forward`` 描述一个求积点和一对基函数。点数据 "
"``disp`` 和 ``alpha`` 以 ``graddisp`` 和 ``alpha`` 的形式传入："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:121
#: acaeb3969e7242308b5ac80befbd3337
msgid "Single-edge-notched tension"
msgstr "单边缺口拉伸"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:123
#: 2891ee5bae3c4658bfed144f6f25d845
msgid ""
"**Geometry**: the unit square :math:`[0, 1]^2` mm, with a slit along "
":math:`y = 0.5` from the left edge to the centre. The elements above the "
"slit have their own copies of its nodes, so its faces separate freely."
msgstr ""
"**几何**\\ ：单位正方形 :math:`[0, 1]^2` mm，沿 :math:`y = 0.5` "
"从左边缘到中心开有一条狭缝。狭缝上方的单元拥有其节点的独立副本，因此两侧缝面可以自由分开。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:126
#: ab3f2332eaf6471cb4a9539c3ac9a41d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Material**: :math:`E = 210` kN/mm², :math:`\\nu = 0.3`, :math:`G_c = 2.7 "
"\\times 10^{-3}` kN/mm, :math:`\\ell = 0.015` mm, AT1, :math:`g_0 = "
"10^{-6}`."
msgstr ""
"**材料**\\ ：\\ :math:`E = 210` kN/mm²，\\ :math:`\\nu = 0.3`\\ ，\\ :math:`G_c ="
" 2.7 \\times 10^{-3}` kN/mm，\\ :math:`\\ell = 0.015` mm，AT1，\\ :math:`g_0 = "
"10^{-6}`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:129
#: d9569cf230d54b57b9c8d3d48b5e1e0e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Loading**: bottom clamped; top :math:`u_x = 0`, :math:`u_y = \\delta`, in "
"increments of :math:`10^{-4}` mm."
msgstr ""
"**加载**\\ ：底边固支；顶边 :math:`u_x = 0`\\ 、\\ :math:`u_y = \\delta`\\ ，增量为 "
":math:`10^{-4}` mm。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:131
#: 6c77cc27612d437a8eb74c6b5dcca74d
msgid ""
"**Mesh**: union-jack triangles, built with NumPy. The diagonals alternate "
"like a checkerboard, so the mesh is mirror-symmetric about the crack line "
"and favours no crack direction. :math:`h = \\ell / 2` in a band around the "
"crack path, coarser above and below (about 6,400 nodes)."
msgstr ""
"**网格**\\ ：用 NumPy 生成的对角线交错（union-"
"jack）三角形网格。相邻单元的对角线像棋盘一样交替，因此网格关于裂纹线镜像对称，不偏向任何裂纹方向。在裂纹路径附近的条带内 :math:`h = "
"\\ell / 2`\\ ，其上下更粗（约 6,400 个节点）。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:136
#: 572ae5f434e9402f94d45706e6721b51
msgid ""
"Damage at the slit tip at peak load, the broken specimen, and the load-"
"displacement curve"
msgstr "峰值载荷时狭缝尖端的损伤、断裂后的试样以及载荷-位移曲线"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:140
#: 8f2199ff39b946d5acd5f5e1d2dc18ff
msgid ""
"Output of ``phase_field_fracture.py``. Left: the damage around the slit tip "
"(white line) at peak load. Middle: the broken specimen, with displacements "
"magnified. Right: the reaction force on the top edge."
msgstr ""
"``phase_field_fracture.py`` "
"的输出。左：峰值载荷时狭缝尖端（白线）附近的损伤。中：断裂后的试样，位移经过放大。右：顶边上的反力。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:144
#: 7cd794c140a7449d9b3f4271bcc5cc44
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The response is linear elastic until :math:`\\delta \\approx 3.9 \\times "
"10^{-3}` mm (:math:`F \\approx 0.55` kN), when damage first appears at the "
"slit tip: AT1 has an elastic phase. A process zone then grows at the tip "
"while the load keeps rising, to a peak of 0.87 kN at :math:`\\delta = 6.2 "
"\\times 10^{-3}` mm. In the next load step the crack runs straight through "
"the ligament and the reaction drops to zero. Under displacement control this"
" propagation is unstable, so it happens within a single step."
msgstr ""
"在 :math:`\\delta \\approx 3.9 \\times 10^{-3}` mm（\\ :math:`F \\approx 0.55`"
" kN）之前，响应是线弹性的，此时狭缝尖端才首次出现损伤：AT1 有弹性阶段。随后尖端的过程区不断长大，而载荷继续上升，在 :math:`\\delta"
" = 6.2 \\times 10^{-3}` mm 时达到 0.87 kN "
"的峰值。在下一个载荷步中，裂纹笔直地贯穿韧带，反力降为零。在位移控制下这种扩展是不稳定的，因此在单个载荷步内完成。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:152
#: 1c09409158b74e16b114aa1ce96ae900
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Elastic steps take one or two staggered iterations, and steps with a growing"
" process zone up to about thirty. The step in which the crack runs takes "
"138, out of about 320 for the whole run. With ``--model at2`` damage grows "
"from the first step and the response softens before the peak (0.73 kN at "
":math:`\\delta = 5.9 \\times 10^{-3}` mm), but the crack again runs through "
"in one step."
msgstr ""
"弹性阶段每步只需一到两次交错迭代，过程区增长的步最多约三十次。裂纹扩展的那一步需要 138 次，整个计算共约 320 次。使用 ``--model "
"at2`` 时，损伤从第一步就开始增长，响应在峰值之前就已软化（\\ :math:`\\delta = 5.9 \\times 10^{-3}` mm "
"时为 0.73 kN），但裂纹同样在一个载荷步内贯穿。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:161
#: 8df328877287443c8ea142aae96a377a
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:163
#: 86a474907b15457a9111393ff3ccc8a5
msgid "``tests/assemble/test_phase_field_fracture_example.py`` checks:"
msgstr "``tests/assemble/test_phase_field_fracture_example.py`` 检查以下内容："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:165
#: bf2238b8f71b43fc924d09a210e3212a
msgid ""
"**Hessians**: the assembled Hessians against central differences of the "
"autograd residuals."
msgstr "**Hessian**\\ ：将装配得到的 Hessian 与 autograd 残差的中心差分进行比较。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:167
#: 4fcc22e67c7640bea35aee54a4d297ae
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Homogeneous solution**: a strip in uniaxial tension with AT1 stays "
"undamaged below the critical strain :math:`\\varepsilon_c = \\sqrt{3 G_c (1 "
"- \\nu^2) / (8 E \\ell)}`. Above it, the damage is :math:`\\alpha = 1 - "
"(\\varepsilon_c / \\varepsilon)^2`, and the reaction force is "
":math:`g(\\alpha)\\, E \\varepsilon / (1 - \\nu^2)` times the width."
msgstr ""
"**均匀解**\\ ：AT1 下单轴拉伸的条带在临界应变 :math:`\\varepsilon_c = \\sqrt{3 G_c (1 - "
"\\nu^2) / (8 E \\ell)}` 以下保持无损伤。超过临界应变后，损伤为 :math:`\\alpha = 1 - "
"(\\varepsilon_c / \\varepsilon)^2`\\ ，反力为 :math:`g(\\alpha)\\, E "
"\\varepsilon / (1 - \\nu^2)` 乘以宽度。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:173
#: 1a78ffceb1e84e86ab11c68fa569e0b8
msgid ""
"**Irreversibility**: damage never decreases, including after an unloading "
"step."
msgstr "**不可逆性**\\ ：损伤从不减小，卸载步之后也是如此。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:175
#: 7fa3ecfd1f204cc18b9f410751d30773
msgid ""
"**Prescribed damage**: nodes held at :math:`\\alpha = 1` through "
"``alpha_fixed`` stay there exactly."
msgstr "**给定损伤**\\ ：通过 ``alpha_fixed`` 保持在 :math:`\\alpha = 1` 的节点严格保持该值。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:177
#: 3e944b423f0c459ca917ef325d29d1f7
msgid ""
"**Coarse SENT run**: the crack starts at the slit tip and runs straight "
"along :math:`y = 0.5` to the right edge. It dissipates :math:`G_c` times its"
" length, up to the effective-toughness factor of the mesh (see below)."
msgstr ""
"**粗网格 SENT 算例**\\ ：裂纹从狭缝尖端出发，沿 :math:`y = 0.5` 笔直扩展到右边缘。它耗散的能量为 :math:`G_c` "
"乘以裂纹长度，相差一个与网格有关的有效韧性系数（见下文）。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:183
#: c3fd8e113d35442396b571e6a6c26314
msgid "Running it"
msgstr "运行它"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:192
#: 2a49efdd90674116b890210ef413782a
msgid ""
"The default run takes about a minute on one CPU node (AT2: about one and a "
"half), and the coarse one a few seconds. ``--device cuda`` assembles on the "
"GPU. The Newton systems then use cuDSS if torch-sla has it, and SciPy on the"
" host otherwise."
msgstr ""
"默认算例在一个 CPU 节点上约需一分钟（AT2 约一分半），粗网格算例只需几秒。\\ ``--device cuda`` 在 GPU "
"上装配，此时牛顿方程组在 torch-sla 支持 cuDSS 时用 cuDSS 求解，否则在主机上用 SciPy 求解。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:199
#: 4beb09bfc3974bbdb3bf7e4a1d2d7b55
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:201
#: 9e9529ec73084937a2ada352dc8e6633
msgid ""
"**Resolution.** :math:`h` must resolve :math:`\\ell` (here :math:`h = "
"\\ell/2`). The dissipated energy then exceeds :math:`G_c` times the crack "
"length by a mesh-dependent factor, because a fully broken band is at least "
"one element wide. Here the 0.5 mm crack dissipates :math:`0.61\\, G_c`, a "
"factor of 1.22."
msgstr ""
"**分辨率。** :math:`h` 必须能分辨 :math:`\\ell`\\ （这里 :math:`h = \\ell/2`\\ ）。此时耗散能会比"
" :math:`G_c` 乘以裂纹长度多出一个与网格有关的系数，因为完全断裂的带至少有一个单元宽。这里 0.5 mm 的裂纹耗散 "
":math:`0.61\\, G_c`\\ ，系数为 1.22。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:206
#: 99b1fc44d1e84b82b4339f4f9e16de12
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**The length scale is a material parameter.** With AT1, :math:`\\ell` also "
"sets the strength, :math:`\\sigma_c = \\sqrt{3 G_c E' / (8 \\ell)}` with "
":math:`E' = E / (1 - \\nu^2)` in plane strain [Tanne2018]_. Changing "
":math:`\\ell` changes when a crack nucleates, not only how smooth it is."
msgstr ""
"**长度尺度是材料参数。** 对 AT1，\\ :math:`\\ell` 还决定了强度 :math:`\\sigma_c = \\sqrt{3 G_c"
" E' / (8 \\ell)}`\\ ，平面应变下 :math:`E' = E / (1 - \\nu^2)` [Tanne2018]_。改变 "
":math:`\\ell` 不仅改变裂纹的光滑程度，也改变裂纹何时萌生。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:210
#: e9c9952ef6884267b54e881eff81e3c6
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Solver.** Alternate minimization is robust but slow while a crack runs. "
"Over-relaxing the damage update [Farrell2017]_ helps: ``--relaxation 1.6`` "
"gives the same result here with 15–20 % fewer iterations, and saves more "
"when a crack grows over many load steps. Composite and monolithic Newton "
"schemes can need fewer iterations still, and they impose the bounds with the"
" same ``vi_solve`` call."
msgstr ""
"**求解器。** 交替最小化稳健，但在裂纹扩展时收敛较慢。对损伤更新做超松弛 [Farrell2017]_ 有帮助：这里 ``--relaxation "
"1.6`` 得到相同的结果，迭代次数少 15–20 "
"%；当裂纹在许多载荷步中逐步扩展时节省更多。复合牛顿法和整体（monolithic）牛顿法所需的迭代还可以更少，它们同样用 ``vi_solve`` "
"施加界约束。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/solid/phase_field_fracture.rst:219
#: 4336b947617b4201b4eecd9404916662
msgid "What's next"
msgstr "下一步"

