msgid ""
":doc:`plasticity_strip`: history variables updated once per step, the other "
"way to make a solid model path-dependent."
msgstr ":doc:`plasticity_strip`\\ ：每步更新一次的历史变量，这是让固体模型具有路径相关性的另一种方式。"

